prescribed for this condition. Besides her eating disorder, she has been honest about her tobacco use, having smoked 5 cigarettes per day since January 2019. Additionally, she reports consuming approximately 10 alcoholic drinks per week.\n\nPhysical exams during her visits have consistently shown normal findings, and there are no other significant medical conditions reported. Any minor complaints such as headaches or mild gastrointestinal discomfort have been addressed but do not affect her overall health status. \n\nIn summary, Mary Conway continues to manage her eating disorder well and has been in"
